<title>USA: MicroTouch, Elo settle patent suit.</title>
<headline>MicroTouch, Elo settle patent suit.</headline>
<dateline>METHUEN, Mass. 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>MicroTouch Systems Inc and Elo TouchSystems Inc, a subsidiary of Raychem Corp said Friday they have settled two patent infringement lawsuits relating to touchscreen technology.</p>
<p>Terms of the agreement are not being disclosed.</p>
<p>The agreement resolves a patent infringement lawsuit filed by Elo against MicroTouch, Graphics Technology Co and Touch Technology during 1993 in Tennessee, as well as a patent infringement lawsuit against Elo by MicroTouch and Peptek Inc during 1995 in Boston. MicroTouch and Elo are suppliers of computer touchscreen products and related software.</p>
</text>
